{"title":"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/5/ef5952af8782b3a1afbfcfdccf20bdfa2f01eef4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7x - 3 = 60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"95\" height=\"15\" />, the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/4/ce42b9ff076beb141bd3bb95db7d038f954bf45e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 9 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 7 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 10 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 6 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"360\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can simply solve the equation:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/5/ef5952af8782b3a1afbfcfdccf20bdfa2f01eef4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7x - 3 = 60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"95\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/c/d5c9a309524917b3add6022f2b4c29368ed07ba7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7x = 60 + 3 = 63$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"137\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/b/a0b13eed8a9a8ce84a036609daf183c4cc76220b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{63}{7} = \\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } 9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"139\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/ind